1
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:16,868
Quand j'étais petit, j'habitais dans un village près de Lyon.
When I was little, I lived in a village near Lyon.

2
00:00:16,968 --> 00:00:24,428
Moi, j'habitais à Paris, dans un petit appartement. On n'avait pas de jardin.
I lived in Paris, in a small apartment. We didn't have a garden.

3
00:00:24,528 --> 00:00:32,180
Nous, on avait un grand jardin et un chien. Tous les jours, je jouais dehors avec ma sœur.
We had a big garden and a dog. Every day I played outside with my sister.

4
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:35,900
Et à l'école, tu étais comment ?
And at school, what were you like?

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,364
J'étais très timide, mais j'aimais beaucoup lire.
I was very shy, but I loved reading.

6
00:00:40,464 --> 00:00:47,468
Moi, je dessinais tout le temps. Mes parents disaient que j'avais trop d'imagination !
I drew all the time. My parents said I had too much imagination!
